ions Inc.\\n*2021 \342\200\223 Present*\\n- **Spearheaded development** of responsive client-facing web applications using **React**, **JavaScript**, **HTML5**, and **CSS3**, improving user engagement and page load performance.\\n- **Engineered modular React components** and integrated **TypeScript** to enhance code maintainability and reduce runtime defects by [X]%.\\n- **Collaborated with backend engineering teams** to build and consume **REST APIs** powered by **Node.js** and **Express** for microservices architecture.\\n- **Participated in CI/CD pipeline automation** and automated testing protocols to streamline continuous deployment cycles.\\n- **Optimized application performance** and cross-browser compatibility across desktop and mobile devices.\\n\\n## Education\\n\\n### Bachelor of Science in Computer Science\\nState University | *Graduated 2021*\\n\",\"atsFormattingTips\":[\"Use standard, clean fonts such as Arial, Calibri, or Helvetica when exporting to PDF or Word.\",\"Avoid using complex tables, text boxes, or graphics that can confuse ATS parsers.\",\"Ensure section headings use universal titles (e.g., \'Professional Experience\', \'Technical Skills\').\",\"Save and upload your resume in .docx or standard text-searchable .pdf format.\"],\"rawAnalysis\":{\"strengths\":[\"Solid core experience with React, JavaScript, and Node.js\",\"Good foundation in both frontend and backend development\"],\"gapsIdentified\":[\"Needs explicit highlighting of TypeScript, Express, microservices, and CI/CD competencies required for the Senior role\"]}}\n```\n\n"
