  system_message {
    message: "[Message] timestamp=2026-08-01T22:06:23Z sender=4a543437-3cad-463f-adf7-27c86bffb6a5/task-30 priority=MESSAGE_PRIORITY_HIGH content=Task id \"4a543437-3cad-463f-adf7-27c86bffb6a5/task-30\" finished with result:\nCommand output:\n{\"success\":true,\"matchScore\":72,\"keyKeywordsMatched\":[\"JavaScript\",\"React\",\"Node.js\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Web Applications\"],\"missingKeywordsAdded\":[\"TypeScript\",\"Express\",\"REST APIs\",\"Microservices\",\"Cloud deployment\",\"Performance optimization\",\"CI/CD\",\"Automated Testing\"],\"improvementsSummary\":[\"Re-architected bullet points using the STAR method with quantifiable metric placeholders.\",\"Integrated critical full-stack concepts like REST APIs, microservices, performance optimization, and testing workflows.\",\"Reframed backend experience with Node.js and Express to highlight full-stack capabilities.\",\"Structured technical skills into clean, ATS-scannable categories.\"],\"optimizedResume\":\"# John Doe\\\\nEmail: john.doe@email.com | Phone: (555) 123-4567 | Location: City, State\\\\nLinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/johndoe | GitHub: github.com/johndoe\\\\n\\\\n## Professional Summary\\\\nResults-driven Full Stack Engineer with 3+ years of experience building scalable web applications using JavaScript, React, and Node.js. Proven track record of optimizing application performance, developing REST APIs, and contributing to microservices architecture. Skilled in integrating TypeScript, automated testing, and modern CI/CD pipelines to drive high-quality software delivery.\\\\n\\\\n## Core Competencies / Technical Skills\\\\n* **Languages:** JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript, HTML5, CSS3\\\\n* **Frontend:** React, Redux, Webpack, Responsive Design\\\\n* **Backend:** Node.js, Express, REST APIs, Microservices Architecture\\\\n* **Testing & DevOps:** Automated Testing (Jest), CI/CD, Cloud Deployment, Git\\\\n\\\\n## Professional Experience\\\\n**Software Developer** | Tech Company Inc. | 2021 \342\200\223 Present\\\\n* Engineered full-stack web applications using JavaScript, React, and Node.js, boosting system performance by [X]%.\\\\n* Implemented scalable REST APIs and microservices endpoints using Express to enhance frontend-backend integration.\\\\n* Executed code refactoring and performance optimization tactics, reducing web page load times by [Y]%.\\\\n* Collaborated on automated testing frameworks and CI/CD pipelines to ensure continuous delivery and robust code reliability.\\\\n\\\\n## Education & Certifications\\\\n**Bachelor of Science in Computer Science** | University Name | 2021\",\"atsFormattingTips\":[\"Use clear standard headers like Professional Summary, Technical Skills, and Professional Experience.\",\"Ensure resume is saved in standard .docx or text-based PDF format for optimal ATS parsing.\",\"Replace metric placeholders like [X]% with exact achievements prior to sending.\",\"Avoid using tables, graphics, or nested text boxes which cause parser errors in systems like Workday or Taleo.\"],\"rawAnalysis\":{\"strengths\":[\"Solid 3-year background in core JavaScript, React, and frontend application development.\",\"Hands-on exposure assisting backend development with Node.js.\"],\"gapsIdentified\":[\"Original text lacked explicit references to TypeScript, Express, microservices, and cloud deployments.\",\"Absence of quantitative impact metrics in the candidate\'s initial resume draft.\"]}}"
    render_info {
      title: "Curl optimize-resume endpoint finished"
      markdown: "Task id \"4a543437-3cad-463f-adf7-27c86bffb6a5/task-30\" finished with result:\nCommand output:\n{\"success\":true,\"matchScore\":72,\"keyKeywordsMatched\":[\"JavaScript\",\"React\",\"Node.js\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Web Applications\"],\"missingKeywordsAdded\":[\"TypeScript\",\"Express\",\"REST APIs\",\"Microservices\",\"Cloud deployment\",\"Performance optimization\",\"CI/CD\",\"Automated Testing\"],\"improvementsSummary\":[\"Re-architected bullet points using the STAR method with quantifiable metric placeholders.\",\"Integrated critical full-stack concepts like REST APIs, microservices, performance optimization, and testing workflows.\",\"Reframed backend experience with Node.js and Express to highlight full-stack capabilities.\",\"Structured technical skills into clean, ATS-scannable categories.\"],\"optimizedResume\":\"# John Doe\\\\nEmail: john.doe@email.com | Phone: (555) 123-4567 | Location: City, State\\\\nLinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/johndoe | GitHub: github.com/johndoe\\\\n\\\\n## Professional Summary\\\\nResults-driven Full Stack Engineer with 3+ years of experience building scalable web applications using JavaScript, React, and Node.js. Proven track record of optimizing application performance, developing REST APIs, and contributing to microservices architecture. Skilled in integrating TypeScript, automated testing, and modern CI/CD pipelines to drive high-quality software delivery.\\\\n\\\\n## Core Competencies / Technical Skills\\\\n* **Languages:** JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript, HTML5, CSS3\\\\n* **Frontend:** React, Redux, Webpack, Responsive Design\\\\n* **Backend:** Node.js, Express, REST APIs, Microservices Architecture\\\\n* **Testing & DevOps:** Automated Testing (Jest), CI/CD, Cloud Deployment, Git\\\\n\\\\n## Professional Experience\\\\n**Software Developer** | Tech Company Inc. | 2021 \342\200\223 Present\\\\n* Engineered full-stack web applications using JavaScript, React, and Node.js, boosting system performance by [X]%.\\\\n* Implemented scalable REST APIs and microservices endpoints using Express to enhance frontend-backend integration.\\\\n* Executed code refactoring and performance optimization tactics, reducing web page load times by [Y]%.\\\\n* Collaborated on automated testing frameworks and CI/CD pipelines to ensure continuous delivery and robust code reliability.\\\\n\\\\n## Education & Certifications\\\\n**Bachelor of Science in Computer Science** | University Name | 2021\",\"atsFormattingTips\":[\"Use clear standard headers like Professional Summary, Technical Skills, and Professional Experience.\",\"Ensure resume is saved in standard .docx or text-based PDF format for optimal ATS parsing.\",\"Replace metric placeholders like [X]% with exact achievements prior to sending.\",\"Avoid using tables, graphics, or nested text boxes which cause parser errors in systems like Workday or Taleo.\"],\"rawAnalysis\":{\"strengths\":[\"Solid 3-year background in core JavaScript, React, and frontend application development.\",\"Hands-on exposure assisting backend development with Node.js.\"],\"gapsIdentified\":[\"Original text lacked explicit references to TypeScript, Express, microservices, and cloud deployments.\",\"Absence of quantitative impact metrics in the candidate\'s initial resume draft.\"]}}"
