kdown code toggle.\n  - **ATS Keyword Breakdown**: Visual badges separating newly injected missing keywords from preserved existing skills.\n  - **Bullet Point & Gap Analysis**: Categorized STAR impact enhancements and actionable ATS formatting tips.\n- **Build & Verification**: Both `lint_applet` and `compile_applet` passed cleanly with zero type or build errors."
